   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Persian: Ezafe construction and\n  rich verb inflection\n• Kurdish: split ergativity\n• Pashto: verbs agree with several\n  arguments at once\n• Pamir languages: up to five\n  agreement slots per verb",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "• Persian: Ezafe construction and\n  rich verb inflection\n• Kurdish: split ergativity\n• Pashto: verbs agree with several\n  arguments at once\n• Pamir languages: up to five\n  agreement slots per verb",
